  "question": {
    "text": "A bead of weight $w$ can slide on smooth circular wire in a vertical plane. The bead is attached by a light thread to the highest point of the wire and in equilibrium, the thread is taut and make an angle $\\theta$ with the vertical then tension of the thread and reaction of the wire on the bead are",
